---
description: Removing splash loading screen from pages
globs: 
alwaysApply: false
---
This section in src/app.html does this
```
				// Immediately hide splash screen
				if (window.location.pathname.includes('/chatgpt-alternative') || 
				    window.location.pathname.includes('/h') || 
				    window.location.pathname.includes('/pricing') || 
					window.location.pathname.includes('/api-pricing') || 
				    window.location.pathname.includes('/legal')) {
					document.getElementById('splash-screen').style.display = 'none';
				}
```